<title>USA: Milwaukee NAPM shows area growth slower in Dec.</title>
<headline>Milwaukee NAPM shows area growth slower in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Association of Purchasing Management-Milwaukee report showed the area's economy slowed in December from November, the association said Monday.</p>
<p>The Business Survey Report's Milwaukee index fell four points to 52, new orders fell three points to 58, and production declined two points to 56, it said.</p>
